  "label": "Islamophobia",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references Islamophobia by using the phrase 'our peaceful religion' in the context of a violent scene, which is a common tactic to frame religious groups as victims of mockery while weaponizing suffering. This aligns with the stereotype that Muslims are associated with terrorism and violence, even when the religion itself is peaceful. The meme uses this stereotype to provoke emotional reactions and delegitimize criticism of the religion by equating it with violence.",
